---
description: Pillow repository engineering rules for Cursor agents
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the root `AGENTS.md` in this repository.

Pillow is self-contained for product work: build, test, and code changes must
not assume an external session bridge, shared vault wiki, or sibling legacy
resource manager.

Optional maintainer-only orchestration (local session recording, multi-profile
CLI isolation) is documented only on machines that keep a gitignored runbook
under `.superpowers/RUNBOOK.md`. Do not invent vault QUERY/INGEST steps or
absolute paths outside this repository unless a task file in-tree explicitly
requires a named recorded fact.
